    "description": "Shown when a typed file name holds a C0 control character or DEL - a tab, a newline, or similar. Named separately from commonNameIllegal because that sentence lists the characters it refuses, and these have no printable form to list. A keyboard cannot type one; a paste from a spreadsheet or a web page can carry one in.",
